Z||000000||docprego||04-02-2001||01:39 AM||||Hi all,<P>I pulled the GT out of the garage tonight just before sunset and snapped some pics.  <P>Because of the relative darkness, the flash went off on most of thm, as a result they came out looking like it was pitch black out.  This is not the case.  Actually it was just at sunset with a beautiful multi colored sky in the background.  There are a few shots I took without the flash that you can see the actual daylight and sky.  You will know which ones I mean.<P>Here is the album: <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=112028&a=12401425" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=112028&a=12401425</A> <P>docprego <A HREF="http://www.playitagain-games.com" TARGET=_blank>www.playitagain-games.com</A> <BR>||||reg||1
